          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What's Inside Counts: Why Beef Liver Works</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_faVBT6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Rudy’s Freeze Dried Beef Liver Treats are made with 100% USDA beef liver—no grains, fillers, or artificial additives. This single-ingredient purity makes them ideal for dogs with sensitive stomachs or dietary restrictions. Beef liver is a powerhouse of nutrients that provide:<br/><br/>●Protein for muscle repair and energy<br/>●Vitamin A to support eye health and immunity<br/>●B Vitamins for better metabolism and nervous system function<br/>●Iron and essential minerals to promote overall vitality<br/><br/>Not only does it boost your dog’s energy and focus during training, but the rich aroma makes it irresistible to even the pickiest eaters. After switching to Rudy’s beef liver treats, my rescue dog, Tank, showed a noticeable improvement in coat shine and energy.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
