        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Freeze-drying is a key factor in preserving the natural benefits of beef liver. Unlike other preservation methods that can degrade nutrients through heat, freeze-drying locks in all the essential vitamins, minerals, and enzymes. The result is a treat that’s as nutritious as it is tasty. Plus, the freeze-drying process keeps the treats lightweight and shelf-stable, making them perfect for on-the-go pet parents.</p>"
          }
        }
